{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "5089107b1fb08c61fb07ba9ee6ba105f4f591d539a14684fe1c4f694ee553a17", "ja": "勝利と撮れ高、どっちも狙って！", "zh": "胜利和播出镜头，两手都要抓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "273ea0b388fd36788462d06a74d0923fdfcba969dcaf9c3d08c9e96baa8f5651", "ja": "これまでの戦績を踏まえて、アイドルたちは\n満足したり反省したり。多くの競技で大活躍\nを見せた海美や昴とは対照的に、紬は失態\nばかりだったと落ちこむ。そして名誉挽回の\nためラストの騎馬戦へと勝負をかける。", "zh": "结合之前的战绩，偶像们有的感到满足，有的进行反省。与在多项比赛中大显身手的海美和昴相反，紬因自己尽是失误而情绪低落。为了挽回名誉，她将赌注押在最后的骑马战上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "39181a09a51db105269956a911f74f28b3b5a67866d0edb48c960d1947f0b2fb", "ja": "よっしゃー！　バラエティ水球はオレが得点王だぜ♪", "zh": "太好了！综艺水球项目里，我可是得分王哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "f8954a235bf27a16e2d7923c52ce2824a8f3df1588bedd5a78f728f333400a01", "ja": "すばるんのボール、速かった～！\n私も惜しかったんだけどな～。", "zh": "昴的球，速度好快～！\n我也就差一点了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9984ab312b08a069506aafa3438818233f1e6d41ea281c2b976980bf8af44ac4", "ja": "お疲れ様。昴も海美も、今日は大活躍だったな！", "zh": "辛苦了。昴和海美今天都大显身手了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "1e7c9debc5524c0e669170c6a3a5017f33f075ff26a01fcb707e7f56cb01fb39", "ja": "だって私たち、夏もプールも運動も筋肉も\n大好きだからね～！　ね、すばるん☆", "zh": "因为我们都最喜欢夏天、泳池、运动和肌肉了嘛～！对吧，昴昴☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "c2d97d2f55b80e334edb29925e199d50357c243e4e133e78da3022f8d1bbeff6", "ja": "へへっ、まぁな！\n夏といえばプールか野球だもんな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那当然！\n说到夏天，就得是游泳池或棒球嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f164a5809abe73120af64dfbf127bc9467c4f57ad5ea4847a16a0d2dcb01ef40", "ja": "高坂さんも永吉さんも、さすがですね、\n……それに比べて、うちは……。", "zh": "高坂小姐和永吉小姐真不愧是……再看看我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "d05dd869df873f4ba3b6268a0088357d4555b29b8582ef1d17ba39c55d17d58b", "ja": "紬さんも、スーパーシュート決めてたじゃないですか！\n……その、味方のゴールに。", "zh": "紬小姐不是也踢进过超级漂亮的一球吗！……只不过，是踢进自己队的球门就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "658a826b67bec2160ebd036387e0e9b59bf38dabdbd53870af224f833bfea9d2", "ja": "ほ、ほら、水上25m走もすっごく速かったよね！\n……ワニも、ものすごく……。", "zh": "那、那个，你看，水上25m赛跑也快得不得了，对吧！\n……鳄鱼也，特别……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "a1469f65d15faca2600e66f00f40a338c12c28020f8e868fddb81fb9ff551453", "ja": "いやー、茜ちゃんほどじゃないけど、つむりんの\n撮れ高すごいと思うよ！　動きの全部が名場面！", "zh": "哎呀——虽然比不上小茜，不过我觉得\n小紬的有效镜头超多的哦！每个动作都是名场面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f9b4debdfa9c74786359da59bd063f9ffb42070f7d9a3927d06f05e8063d1073", "ja": "ううっ、うれしくありません～～～っ！", "zh": "呜呜，我一点也不高兴～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "83ad253776008149da87779f7345b221dc9ef62a8728695f882a78aa7a889d3c", "ja": "お待たせいたしました！　いよいよラストバトル！\n6チーム対抗・水中騎馬戦のお時間です！", "zh": "让大家久等了！终于到了最终决战！\n现在是6队对抗的水中骑马战时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1011_audience", "source_sha256": "9472c3664950974163e54794663e09bbaf3749371956a07ce6412d2f2ed1fa44", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "e3820c82ca80fda34c44c16b8cd6e56dd93cd286954cf9da77e8b7ae126afc8c", "ja": "あー、とうとう次で終わりか～。\nよーしっ、最後は絶対、得点王になるぞ～っ！", "zh": "啊～，终于下一场就是最后了吗～。\n好～，最后我一定要拿下得分王～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "7eee53f3d7850402e5ab8521f8657e73f8f7269563a2ac3ca8be75ef8f81947c", "ja": "へへっ、オレだって負けないぜ！　紬も最後に\n一発逆転、サヨナラホームラン狙っていけよな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也不会输的！　紬最后也瞄准一记逆转的再见本垒打吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8563986784e66baf1704d08beb5f1561b095ed7d388fed4bbff52c73467fc976", "ja": "……そ、そうですね。このままでは終われません。\n今度こそパフォーマンスで盛り上げてみせます！", "zh": "……是、是的呢。绝不能就这样结束。\n这次我一定会用表演把气氛带向高潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "323369b6a338b45325813dfead24d8bdff2ff6df238e86c1b944e66a18532fde", "ja": "みんな気合い十分だな！　その勢いで最後まで……、\nラストステージまで、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "大家干劲十足啊！就保持这股气势坚持到最后……\n直到最后的舞台，就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
